WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Welcome to ElderScroll,
where your movements control your phone.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Step one: watch the tutorial video
that teaches you the movements.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step two: practise it a few times.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Step three: do it in front of the camera.
When you get it right, you move to the next one.
